<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img class="phero-img" src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-laptop.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-laptop-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-laptop.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.18"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><a href="/ct-claim-tools/">Claim tools</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">RCV vs. ACV Holdback Calculator</span></nav><p class="kicker kicker-light">Free calculator</p><h1>RCV vs. ACV Holdback Calculator</h1><p class="phero-lede">Replacement cost policies usually pay in two stages: an actual cash value check now and recoverable depreciation after repairs. List your items to see the split and the date you need to finish by.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tool"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="dep">
  <div class="tool-head"><span class="tool-t">RCV vs. ACV holdback calculator</span><i>Add as many items as you need</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <div class="table-wrap items-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Replacement cost ($)</th><th>Age (yrs)</th><th>Life (yrs)</th><th>ACV</th><th><span class="sr-only">Remove</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td><input name="item" value="Asphalt shingle roof" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="21400" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="12" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="25" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr><tr><td><input name="item" value="Plaster ceiling & paint — dining room" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="3900" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="6" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="15" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr><tr><td><input name="item" value="Oak strip flooring refinish" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="2650" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="8" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="20" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn line small" data-add data-run>+ Add item</button></div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="d-ded">Deductible ($)</label><input id="d-ded" name="deduct" inputmode="decimal" value="1000"></div>
